New Testament, King James Version, all of it written in that old century English style. It makes you feel like you really never even learned how to read. And I never really felt a true connection with God until I found a way to fully understand it. So many people give up on reading the Bible because of how hard it is to read it, but having it in a modern language in a way that clearly explains everything, it just makes all the difference. And I came across this study guide, and ever since then, every week at church, I came across study guide. And ever since then, every week at church when there's a different story being told, I can actually relate to it. You're not alone if you don't— you're not alone if you don't understand all the verses and scriptures being told at your church. And as a matter of fact, honestly, most Christians feel the same way. And But now there's truly a better way to connect to our faith. I know they didn't make a lot of these, so if you still see it here, you can try and grab one. It's really made the change in my life, and it can do the exact same thing for you. It's really made such a huge change in my life, and it can do the exact same thing for you.","clean_text":"I would go to church and feel stupid nodding my head and singing along to every song but truly never understanding the meaning behind everything. Because you know, you're reading the Bible and you're trying to understand it but you can't, so you just literally want to rip your hair out. The Old Testament, the New Testament, King James Version, all of it written in that old century English style. It makes you feel like you really never even learned how to read. And I never really felt a true connection with God until I found a way to fully understand it. So many people give up on reading the Bible because of how hard it is to read it, but having it in a modern language in a way that clearly explains everything, it just makes all the difference. And I came across this study guide, and ever since then, every week at church, I came across study guide. And ever since then, every week at church when there's a different story being told, I can actually relate to it. You're not alone if you don't— you're not alone if you don't understand all the verses and scriptures being told at your church. And as a matter of fact, honestly, most Christians feel the same way. And But now there's truly a better way to connect to our faith. I know they didn't make a lot of these, so if you still see it here, you can try and grab one. It's really made the change in my life, and it can do the exact same thing for you. It's really made such a huge change in my life, and it can do the exact same thing for you."}